  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　とくだいの　アメ。\nレベル６０　いじょうの　ポケモンの\nたいりょくを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "에너지가 가득한 매우 큰 사탕.\n레벨 60 이상인 포켓몬의\nHP를 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充滿能量的特大糖果。\n能提高等級在60以上的\n寶可夢的體力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un énorme bonbon plein d’énergie.\nIl augmente les PV d’un Pokémon de niveau 60\nou supérieur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein riesiges Bonbon, das voller Energie steckt.\nErhöht dauerhaft die KP eines Pokémon ab Level 60.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelo energético enorme que aumenta los PS\nmáximos de un Pokémon de Nv. 60 o superior.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una caramella piena zeppa di energia.\nAumenta i PS di un Pokémon di livello 60\no superiore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A huge candy that is packed with energy. When given\nto a Pokémon at Lv. 60 or higher, it will increase\nthat Pokémon’s HP.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
